H("673.d.4.K",4,"Searching a list item by item from the start is a:","linear search",["binary search","bubble sort","hash lookup"],"Linear search checks each item.")
H("673.d.4.L",3,"Preventing a program from dividing by zero is a form of basic:","error handling",["error creation","speed tuning","file naming"],"Guard against bad operations.")
