H("673.d.6.H",4,"A function called square(5) that sends back 25 is returning a:","value",["error","loop","comment"],"Return statements give results.")
H("673.d.6.I",3,"When calling add(3, 4), the values 3 and 4 are the:","arguments",["classes","modules","comments"],"Arguments are passed in.")
